<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experimental Settings</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure reproducibility and fair comparison across methods, Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Settings ‣ Denoising as Path Planning: Training-Free Acceleration of Diffusion Models with DPCache" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> provides a detailed overview of the hyperparameter settings used for each method in Section 4.2 of the main paper.</p>
</div>
